    "updated_at": "2016-10-28T14:25:18Z",
    "body": "Okay, though note that not everything goes through \"fire an event\" so more complicated invocations that go through \"create an event\" and then \"dispatch\" will still have to account for the Realm somehow.\n\nI'll land this.\n",
